<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31136" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōmentum</span></b> , i,
		n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				city in the country of the Sabines</i>, now <i>Mentana</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 1, 38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 6,
				773</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōmentānus</span></b> ,
				a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to Nomentum</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 4, 5, § 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					13, 119</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">via,</span>”
				<i>the road leading from Rome to Nomentum</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
					52</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōmentāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the Nomentans</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 8, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				9, § 64</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōmentānus</span></b> ,
				i, m., <i>a Roman
			surname</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">L. Cassius Nomentanus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 1, 1, 102</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 8, 11</span></i> et saep.</div>
		‡† <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nŏmĭmus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμιμος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>lawful,
			legitimate</i>, = legitimus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">PATER NOMIMVS,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 5059</span></i>
			.</div>
